{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2TI","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"提摩太后书","commonName":"提摩太后书","title":"提摩太后书","order":55,"numberOfChapters":4,"sha256":"3db4d25e1c0093fdcdad51c3633ff39bedb8bf2310b8ff0930f19f36e0032acc","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2TI/1.json","lastChapterNumber":4,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2TI/4.json","totalNumberOfVerses":83},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["末世的情形"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["你要知道，末世必有艰难的日子，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["因为那时的人都自私自利、贪爱钱财、狂妄自夸、骄傲自负、毁谤亵渎、违背父母、忘恩负义、心不圣洁、"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["冷漠无情、不愿和解、好说谗言、毫无节制、蛮横凶暴、不爱良善、"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["出卖朋友、任意妄为、自高自大、沉溺享乐、不爱上帝，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["徒有敬虔的外表，却无敬虔的实质。你要避开这样的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["这些人溜进别人家里，哄骗那些意志薄弱的妇女。那些妇女心中充满罪恶，受各种邪情私欲驱使，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["虽然常常学习，却始终不能明白真理。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["现在这些人敌对真理，就像从前雅尼和佯庇反对摩西一样，他们的心思坏透了，他们的信仰是虚假的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["不过，他们猖狂不了多久，因为他们的愚昧行径必暴露在众人面前，就像雅尼和佯庇的下场一样。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["圣经的益处"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["但你熟知我的教导、言行、志向、信心、忍耐、爱心、毅力，"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["也知道我在安提阿、以哥念、路司得遭遇了何等的迫害和苦难。但主从这一切患难中救了我。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["其实凡立志在基督耶稣里过敬虔生活的人都会受到迫害。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["而恶人和骗子会变本加厉地作恶，迷惑人，也被人迷惑。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["但你要坚守自己所学所信的，因为你知道是跟谁学的，"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["并且你从小就熟悉圣经。圣经能给你智慧，使你借着信基督耶稣而得救。"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["圣经全部是上帝启示的，有益于教导、督责、使人归正、培养人行义，"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["使属上帝的人得到充分的装备，去行各种善事。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2TI/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2TI/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2TI/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":17}